==Original Issue==
Evaluate using spacy en_core_web_sm to find people, places, and geopolitical entities that would likely need to have their pronunciation looked at. filter with ordinary dictionary to remove false positives.
===example===
import spacy

# Load classical, lightweight CPU-optimized model (~15MB)
nlp = spacy.load("en_core_web_sm")

text = "During the French Revolution, Maximilien Robespierre delivered speeches at the Jacobin Club in Paris."
doc = nlp(text)

# Extract proper nouns (People, Locations, Entities)
proper_nouns = [ent.text for ent in doc.ents if ent.label_ in ("PERSON", "GPE", "LOC", "ORG")]
# Result: ['Maximilien Robespierre', 'Jacobin Club', 'Paris']

